NUSA UV-K5 APRS DIGI
Copyright 2026 YF9UAG / NUSA UV-K5 APRS DIGI

This project is a modified/derived work built from the open-source
Quansheng UV-K5 firmware ecosystem.

Primary upstream base used for this project:
  bg7nzl/uv-k5-v1-firmware
  https://github.com/bg7nzl/uv-k5-v1-firmware

That upstream project is itself based on and/or incorporates work from
projects and contributors including DualTachyon, OneOfEleven, fagci,
egzumer, and others credited by the upstream repository.

Original open firmware:
  DualTachyon/uv-k5-firmware
  https://github.com/DualTachyon/uv-k5-firmware

APRS timing/reference work consulted during REV1G development:
  phdlee/uvk5cec
  https://github.com/phdlee/uvk5cec

NUSA UV-K5 APRS DIGI modifications include APRS digipeater behavior,
Bell 202 / AX.25 work, hardware-timer TX pacing, fixed-position beacon
features, standalone autostart operation, single-VFO APRS operation,
and APRFq keypad configuration.

